<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Password Reset</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f7;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        .email-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .code-box {
            background-color: #4c80e9;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            display: inline-block;
            text-align: center;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .email-container {
                width: 90%;
                padding: 15px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
    <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding: 40px 0;">
            <table class="email-container" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                    <td style="padding-bottom: 5px; text-align: left;">
              <span
                      style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #4c80e9; vertical-align: middle; margin-left: 10px;">DRAM
                Code</span>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0; padding-bottom: 20px;"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td style="padding: 20px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #333;">
                        Hello,<br><br>
                        We've received a request to reset the password for your account. No changes have been made
                        yet.<br><br>
                        Use the following code to reset your password:
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td style="padding: 20px 0;">
                        <p class="code-box"><%= code; %></p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td style="font-size: 14px; color: #666; padding: 20px 0;">
                        If you did not request a new password, please let us know immediately by replying to this email.<br><br>
                        You can find answers to most questions and get in touch with us at <a href="#"
                                                                                              style="color: #4c80e9; text-decoration: none;">support@dramcode.top</a>.
                        We're here to help.
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td
                            style="border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; font-size: 12px; color: #999; text-align: center;">
                        <img src="cid:logo" alt="DRAM Code Logo" width="200">
                        <p>© 2025 DRAM Code. All rights reserved.</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>
</body>

</html>